B.a8K=new A.a2(B.fQ,["Owned by you","Beauty Memory","The preferences and care context Lumi\xe8re may use are visible, editable and yours to remove.","Nothing remembered","Lumi\xe8re will only remember context you confirm.","Your memory controls","Each memory shows its source. You can remove it without losing access to privacy or account controls.","Confirmed","Source","Confirmed by you","Shared by you","Illustrative result","Your routine","Forget this","Skin Profile","A clear view of your cosmetic goals, preferences and current care focus.","Build your Skin Profile","Share preferences or complete a supported experience to begin.","Goals","Preferences","Current focus","Your care","My Products","See what you use, what you saved and where each item fits.","No products saved","Save a recommendation or add what you already use when verified catalogue support is available.","Using","Saved","Paused","Do I Need This?","Product unavailable","Choose an item from My Products or a recommendation.","FICTIONAL DEMO ITEM","Product detail","A controlled demonstration of product reasoning and routine placement. It is not a live product listing.","Why it fits","This demo item illustrates a category fit based on confirmed beauty context. It makes no product-performance claim.","Where it fits","Remove from saved","Save product","No live price, availability, rating, retailer or affiliate relationship is shown.","Buy less. Choose well.","Lumi\xe8re checks your routine, saved items and current focus before suggesting another category.","You may already have this covered","An item you use already fills this category. Start there before adding another.","Consider the category, not a purchase","There may be a routine gap, but a live verified catalogue is not connected.","What this considered","Only your selected item, current routine and confirmed cosmetic context. No analysis score or commercial ranking.","Personal Thread","Progress detail","A calm timeline of supported results and the care choices around them.","Complete a supported experience to form an honest baseline.","Illustrative timeline state. No measured change.","Lumi\xe8re only shows measured change after comparable, validated evidence exists.","Photo storage","See whether Lumi\xe8re keeps any beauty photos and control future saving.","Persistent photo saving is off","This device demo does not upload or retain your photos. Temporary local previews are discarded.","Production photo storage remains unavailable until consent, retention, deletion and legal review are approved.","Continue with deeper personal guidance","Premium connects validated Precision, progress allowances and continuity. Free guidance and privacy controls remain available.","Validated Precision allowances","Comparable progress when scientifically supported","A dedicated Hair Precision journey","Continuity across Coach, routines and Beauty Memory","See plans","Continue free","Activate Premium","Purchase, pending, restore and management states are ready for an approved store connection.","Real purchases are disabled in this demo. No charge can be made.","Premium value","View product","A user-chosen care step; it is not a treatment or measured outcome.","Your product","Move earlier","Move later","Comfort-first skin care","You confirmed that a simple, comfort-led routine matters to you.","Hair softness preference","You shared that softness and manageability guide your care choices.","Natural nail finish","You prefer a restrained, natural-looking finish.","Demo moisture veil","Demo softness conditioner","Demo care oil","A calm, comfortable-looking finish","A short, simple routine","Fragrance-free options where verified","Skin baseline preview","Shows where a validated baseline could appear; this is not measured data.","Routine refined","A moisturizer step was placed in the morning routine.","Hair context added","A softness preference was added to the personal thread."],t.w)
